Data and manuscript text:

The synthetic firm battery, captured model-output CSVs, analysis outputs
(claims.json, tables, figures), and documentation/manuscript text in this
repository are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The code (config/, capture/, analysis/, pilot/, and top-level scripts) is
released under the MIT License above.

Third-party material: data/sec_cache/ holds responses from the U.S. Securities and
Exchange Commission's public company-facts API, and data/firms/real.jsonl is derived
from them. These are public U.S. government records, not our work, and the CC BY 4.0
grant above applies only to our selection and arrangement of them.
